===== 1. 产物构建 =====
$ npm ci --prefix app && npm run build --prefix app
✓ built in 169ms；app/dist/index.html 394 字节
$ cargo build -p yunjian-app --bin yunjian-desktop --features custom-protocol
Finished dev profile in 24.08s；target/debug/yunjian-desktop 407481192 字节
$ make bundle
首轮失败：
  [appimage/stderr] Failed to download runtime: server returned status code 0
  ERROR: Failed to run plugin: appimage (exit code: 1)
真因不是 linuxdeploy 崩了，是 appimagetool 取不到 type2-runtime。
实测：直连 302 但 S3 连接 136 秒后 timeout；带代理立刻成功。
$ strings linuxdeploy-plugin-appimage | grep -E "^LDAI_"
LDAI_RUNTIME_FILE / LDAI_SIGN / LDAI_SIGN_ARGS / LDAI_SIGN_KEY / LDAI_UPD_INFO
（环境变量名从 ELF 里读出，不凭记忆）
$ curl（走代理）-o /config/appimage-runtime-x86_64 .../runtime-x86_64  → 944632 字节
$ LDAI_RUNTIME_FILE=/config/appimage-runtime-x86_64 make bundle
    binary        389M  target/debug/yunjian-desktop
    deb           106M  云笺_0.1.0_amd64.deb
    rpm           106M  云笺-0.1.0-1.x86_64.rpm
